_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "6c5287fb-13ea-4999-86a8-0bdb92b3f796", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud.md", "file_name": "python_cloud.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 14627, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "b1ee1313053e3805b5515bf64e4cd3508c78c88bd99cc82f1278cd1953c9d7e2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "2d00860a-169c-4fd6-9c64-5a90e50eede5", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud.md", "file_name": "python_cloud.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 14627, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "00ce39ff57c06e4451fd41291ff55a44e8f0e74a5c32ad62766641ba8b6f6a9c", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/#available-skills)\r\n  * **llamaparse** : Advanced parsing for PDFs, docs, presentations and images (charts, tables, embedded visuals). Requires `LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY` and Node 18+.\r\n  * **liteparse** : Local-first, fast parsing for text-dense PDFs and docs. No API key needed, requires `@llamaindex/liteparse` globally installed and Node 18+.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n[Section titled \u201cInstallation\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/#installation)\r\nYou can install LlamaParse Agent Skills using the [`skills`](https://skills.sh) CLI:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nnpxskillsaddrun-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nOr, if you wish to download only one skill:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nnpxskillsaddrun-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills--skillllamaparse# or the name of another skill\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can also download the skills folder in `.zip` format from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/run-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills/releases/download/latest/skills-latest.zip).\r\n## Resources\r\n[Section titled \u201cResources\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/#resources)\r\n[ Python SDK ](https://github.com/run-llama/llama-cloud-py) pip install llama-cloud\r\n[ TypeScript SDK ](https://github.com/run-llama/llama-cloud-ts) npm install @llamaindex/llama-cloud\r\n  * [ LlamaParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/)\r\n  * [ LiteParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/liteparse/)\r\n  * [ LlamaAgents ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/llamaagents/)\r\n  * [ LlamaIndex Framework ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 13003, "end_char_idx": 14581, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "7ec0a0eb-2315-4a9c-90ff-bd65a532b1ce", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b84c9dc7-4050-4c8a-8f85-69cc6d12ba52", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "de9b8fe84474789f46c163b6ca1d2f9ac1d7c31ab54a6ea49e4a0ea302572971", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "489a5880-cf9a-4b70-962e-0a110c702819", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "542aef2fb4532cb1a4411f3a6fdb932855d97bafb37d73e4be9fb3d75f9c2330", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#_top)\r\nGuide\r\nClassify\r\n[Overview of Classify](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/)\r\nCopy Markdown\r\nOpen in **Claude**\r\nOpen in **ChatGPT**\r\nOpen in **Cursor**\r\n**Copy Markdown**\r\n**View as Markdown**\r\n# Overview of Classify\r\nLearn what the Classification API is, how rules work, and how to run classifications using the client SDK.\r\nClassify lets you automatically categorize documents into types you define (for example: invoice, receipt, contract) using natural-language rules.\r\nClassify is currently in beta and is subject to breaking changes.\r\n## Use Cases\r\n[Section titled \u201cUse Cases\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#use-cases)\r\n  * **Use as a pre-processing step**\r\n    * **Before extraction** : Classify first, then run schema-specific extraction (e.g., invoice vs. contract) with different LlamaExtract agents to improve accuracy and reduce cost.\r\n    * **Before parsing** : Classify first, then run LlamaParse over labeled files with finely tuned parse settings for each classified category to improve accuracy and reduce cost.\r\n    * **Before indexing** : Classify first, then send classified files into appropriate LlamaCloud indices with tailored chunking, metadata, and access controls to improve retrieval quality.\r\n  * **Intake routing for back-office documents** : Auto-separate invoices, receipts, purchase orders, and bank statements to the right queues, storage buckets, or approval workflows.\r\n  * **Dataset curation** : Auto-tag large archives into meaningful categories to create labeled subsets for model training.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Concepts\r\n[Section titled \u201cConcepts\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#concepts)\r\n  * **Rule** : A content-based criterion for a document type. Each rule has:\r\n    * `type`: the label to assign. Must contain only alphanumeric characters, spaces, hyphens, and underscores. For example: \u201cinvoice\u201d, \u201csec_filing\u201d, \u201cTax Return\u201d, \u201c10-K\u201d.\r\n    * `description`: a natural-language description of the content that should match this type.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 2109, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "489a5880-cf9a-4b70-962e-0a110c702819", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b84c9dc7-4050-4c8a-8f85-69cc6d12ba52", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "de9b8fe84474789f46c163b6ca1d2f9ac1d7c31ab54a6ea49e4a0ea302572971", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "7ec0a0eb-2315-4a9c-90ff-bd65a532b1ce", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "2de0b17372f1c255bec39903ac5d36e36c4bbc68c433862f6500bb84368726b6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "0ea811ff-76cf-4158-b904-ecce1316b63b", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "8ae3e3c5c68cebcf5da183e006061aeb082638e2f18404a7823211786b8da280", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "For example: \u201cinvoice\u201d, \u201csec_filing\u201d, \u201cTax Return\u201d, \u201c10-K\u201d.\r\n    * `description`: a natural-language description of the content that should match this type.\r\n  * **Parsing configuration (optional)** : Controls how we parse documents before classification (e.g., language, page limits). Useful for speed/accuracy tradeoffs.\r\n  * **Results** : For each file you get a `type` (predicted), `confidence` (0.0\u20131.0), and `reasoning` (step-by-step explanation).\r\n\r\n\r\n## Classification Modes\r\n[Section titled \u201cClassification Modes\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#classification-modes)\r\nClassify offers two modes to balance speed, cost, and accuracy:  \r\n| Mode  | Credits per Page  | Best For  |  \r\n| --- | --- | --- |  \r\n| **Fast**  | 1  | Text-heavy documents where layout and visual elements are not important  |  \r\n| **Multimodal**  | 2  | Documents with hand-written text, images, charts, or visual content  |  \r\nFast mode uses text-based classification, making it cost-effective. It works well for documents where content, not layout, determines the type.\r\nMultimodal mode uses vision models to analyze both text and visual elements in your documents. Use this mode if you need higher accuracy on visually rich documents.\r\nTo use Multimodal mode, set the `mode` parameter to `\"MULTIMODAL\"` when creating a classify job. See the [SDK guide](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/sdk) for usage examples.\r\n## Typical flow\r\n[Section titled \u201cTypical flow\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#typical-flow)\r\n  1. Upload your files to LlamaCloud\r\n  2. Create rules for your target classes\r\n  3. Create a classify job with the file ids and rules\r\n  4.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1953, "end_char_idx": 3651, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "0ea811ff-76cf-4158-b904-ecce1316b63b", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b84c9dc7-4050-4c8a-8f85-69cc6d12ba52", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "de9b8fe84474789f46c163b6ca1d2f9ac1d7c31ab54a6ea49e4a0ea302572971", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "489a5880-cf9a-4b70-962e-0a110c702819", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaclassify_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 4508, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "8afaf19b81e72fe1d11b4ef831b180ad1378547ea7eddb5f8c5ba1df5fb4eada", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Upload your files to LlamaCloud\r\n  2. Create rules for your target classes\r\n  3. Create a classify job with the file ids and rules\r\n  4. Fetch results and consume the predictions\r\n\r\n\r\n## Next steps\r\n[Section titled \u201cNext steps\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/#next-steps)\r\n  * Make sure you have an API key: [Get an API key](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/cloud/general/api_key)\r\n  * Jump straight to the SDK guide to run your first job using [the SDK](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/classify/sdk)\r\n  * For use with other languages, see our [API reference](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/reference/resources/classify/)\r\n\r\n\r\n  * [ LlamaParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/)\r\n  * [ LiteParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/liteparse/)\r\n  * [ LlamaAgents ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/llamaagents/)\r\n  * [ LlamaIndex Framework ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 3515, "end_char_idx": 4464, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "33b7224e-589f-4e7b-ae5f-a4fc91d47f75", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "55acea78-7b7f-47c5-89c5-48779c0acae2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9375a2b0faac4c86436c8a7debec2ea2f086be528888c90ec2cbf7f71f8f2468", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "38907fbf-bb52-4b12-abca-4ce965c15590", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "eca2589427c9964274bef05ff4863f4cbc3db9c7bce80b7caa3c7b029df1e478", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#_top)\r\nGuide\r\nExtract\r\n[Overview of Extract](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/)\r\nCopy Markdown\r\nOpen in **Claude**\r\nOpen in **ChatGPT**\r\nOpen in **Cursor**\r\n**Copy Markdown**\r\n**View as Markdown**\r\n# Overview of Extract\r\nIntroduction to LlamaExtract, a tool for extracting structured data from unstructured documents, available as a web UI, Python SDK, and REST API.\r\n## Overview\r\n[Section titled \u201cOverview\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#overview)\r\nLlamaExtract provides a simple API for extracting structured data from unstructured documents like PDFs, text files, and images.\r\nLlamaExtract is available as a web UI, Python SDK and REST API.\r\n### Is LlamaExtract right for me?\r\n[Section titled \u201cIs LlamaExtract right for me?\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#is-llamaextract-right-for-me)\r\nLlamaExtract is a great fit for when you need:\r\n  * **Well-typed data for downstream tasks** : You want to extract data from documents and use it for downstream tasks like training a model, building a dashboard, entering into a database, etc. LlamaExtract guarantees that your data complies with the provided schema or provides helpful error messages when it doesn\u2019t.\r\n  * **Accurate data extraction** : We use the best in class LLM models to extract data from your documents.\r\n  * **Iterative schema development** : You want to quickly iterate on your schema and get feedback on how well it works on your sample documents. Do you need to provide more examples to extract a certain field? Do you need to make a certain field optional?\r\n  * **Support for multiple file types** : LlamaExtract supports a wide range of file types, including PDFs, text files, and images. Let us know if you need support for another file type!", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1848, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "38907fbf-bb52-4b12-abca-4ce965c15590", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "55acea78-7b7f-47c5-89c5-48779c0acae2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9375a2b0faac4c86436c8a7debec2ea2f086be528888c90ec2cbf7f71f8f2468", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "33b7224e-589f-4e7b-ae5f-a4fc91d47f75", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "be2e09cdbc7339b00dfb0b6ad2a55c7335eeacd802efc5862b27e86903a7ccbf", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "a05e431c-4ab1-42d0-a3c4-fee06bfe0b7b", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "a35c547f3731a2d4f152c6b182540e23c23fa848367a2ab8d45b1095c2abe21d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "* **Support for multiple file types** : LlamaExtract supports a wide range of file types, including PDFs, text files, and images. Let us know if you need support for another file type!\r\n\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n[Section titled \u201cQuick Start\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#quick-start)\r\n### Using the web UI\r\n[Section titled \u201cUsing the web UI\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#using-the-web-ui)\r\nThe simplest way to try out LlamaExtract is to [use the web UI](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/web_ui).\r\nJust define your Extraction Configuration (schema and settings), drag and drop any supported document into LlamaParse and extract data from your documents.\r\n### Get an API key\r\n[Section titled \u201cGet an API key\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#get-an-api-key)\r\nOnce you\u2019re ready to start coding, [get an API key](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/general/api_key) to use LlamaExtract with the Python SDK.\r\n### Use our libraries\r\n[Section titled \u201cUse our libraries\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#use-our-libraries)\r\nWe have a library available for Python and Typescript. This is the recommended way to use LlamaExtract for running extraction jobs at scale. Check out the [SDK quick start](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/sdk) to get started.\r\n### REST API\r\n[Section titled \u201cREST API\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#rest-api)\r\nIf you are using a language other than Python, you can use the [REST API](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/api).", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1664, "end_char_idx": 3277, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "a05e431c-4ab1-42d0-a3c4-fee06bfe0b7b", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "55acea78-7b7f-47c5-89c5-48779c0acae2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9375a2b0faac4c86436c8a7debec2ea2f086be528888c90ec2cbf7f71f8f2468", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "38907fbf-bb52-4b12-abca-4ce965c15590", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "3f96fc46fd71abe4dc1c9865b99ea2d9bfa72ae738b8eb50ffc68bf1ac8b4e5e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "53a66fec-1cac-47c4-9c36-6ca557a24e98", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "5fde59fa4364c78e27b0ffa4e832bfb1def2525c3222b755c741430c340c2151", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "### Tiers and versions\r\n[Section titled \u201cTiers and versions\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#tiers-and-versions)\r\nLlamaExtract offers three primary **tiers** in the UI:\r\n  * **Cost Effective** \u2013 best when you want lower cost and higher throughput for simpler extraction tasks.\r\n  * **Agentic** \u2013 recommended default tier that balances quality, speed, and cost for most real\u2011world documents.\r\n  * **Agentic Plus (coming soon)** \u2013 high\u2011fidelity tier for very complex or high\u2011stakes extractions.\r\n\r\n\r\nLlamaExtract now runs on the **v2** APIs by default. If you need to use the **legacy Extract v1** experience, see [Using Extract v1](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#using-extract-v1) below.\r\nWhen using the SDK or REST API directly, V2 decouples parse and extract tiers. Here is how V2 configurations map to V1 equivalents:  \r\n| V2 extract `tier`  | V2 parse `tier`  | V1 equivalent (`extraction_mode`)  |  \r\n| --- | --- | --- |  \r\n| `cost_effective`  | `fast`  | `FAST`  |  \r\n| `agentic`  | `agentic`  | `MULTIMODAL`  |  \r\n| `agentic`  | `agentic_plus`  | `PREMIUM`  |  \r\n### Using Extract v1\r\n[Section titled \u201cUsing Extract v1\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/#using-extract-v1)\r\nLlamaExtract v2 is the default and recommended experience. If you need to use the legacy **Extract v1** :\r\n  * **Web UI** : Open the main LlamaCloud UI, go to **Settings \u2192 General** , and enable the **Extract v1** toggle for your workspace.\r\n  * **Python SDK** : Use the `llama-cloud-services` package (shown as the \u201cPython (legacy)\u201d tab in our SDK examples). See the [SDK page](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/sdk) for details.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 3279, "end_char_idx": 4970, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "53a66fec-1cac-47c4-9c36-6ca557a24e98", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "55acea78-7b7f-47c5-89c5-48779c0acae2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9375a2b0faac4c86436c8a7debec2ea2f086be528888c90ec2cbf7f71f8f2468", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "a05e431c-4ab1-42d0-a3c4-fee06bfe0b7b", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaextract_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 5595, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "2f6a6f164c0007de26148e34d85dc1fdc3aa6b40c364d6bd1f9b2c1b6da3ed80", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "See the [SDK page](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/sdk) for details.\r\n  * **REST API** : The v1 endpoints are documented on the [REST API (v1 Legacy)](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/v1/getting_started/api) page.\r\n\r\n\r\nExtract v1 is legacy and may be deprecated in the future. We recommend migrating to v2 for new projects.\r\n  * [ LlamaParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/)\r\n  * [ LiteParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/liteparse/)\r\n  * [ LlamaAgents ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/llamaagents/)\r\n  * [ LlamaIndex Framework ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 4882, "end_char_idx": 5531, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "b3b4873e-f172-4882-82f6-87ba04382940", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8786047f-5de5-4f7b-939e-ba6d2ca082b6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9ba0fdb9d10277d36469bfa79eb552e210ee783c92f1fe048df7ae6f64697b92", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "e3c5fb8d-9b46-41cf-88b0-376332b2d678", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "bb4e86bc1e199105fa0eceb7ee96d170d224475714be64121dc11e2f5a37b436", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#_top)\r\nGuide\r\nParse\r\nCopy Markdown\r\nOpen in **Claude**\r\nOpen in **ChatGPT**\r\nOpen in **Cursor**\r\n**Copy Markdown**\r\n**View as Markdown**\r\n# Overview of Parse\r\nParse is an agentic document parser built for LLM pipelines\u2014layout-aware OCR that turns PDFs, scans, tables, and charts into clean markdown, text, or JSON.\r\n**Parse is an agentic document parser built for LLM pipelines.** It reads tables, charts, scanned pages, and 130+ file types with layout-aware accuracy that generic OCR and PDF-to-text tools can\u2019t match\u2014and hands you clean markdown, text, or JSON ready to feed straight into your model.\r\n## What teams build with Parse\r\n[Section titled \u201cWhat teams build with Parse\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#what-teams-build-with-parse)\r\n  * **Financial RAG** \u2014 parse tables, footnotes, and charts in 10-Ks, earnings reports, and investor decks without losing cell structure.\r\n  * **Compliance workflows** \u2014 turn filings, transcripts, and policy documents into clean text for automated review and flagging.\r\n  * **Contract intelligence** \u2014 preserve section hierarchy and extract clauses with custom prompts.\r\n  * **Medical & insurance records** \u2014 parse scanned claims, lab reports, and intake forms with reliable field extraction.\r\n  * **Operational documents** \u2014 extract fields from tickets, orders, invoices, and forms for downstream workflows.\r\n  * **Scientific & technical literature** \u2014 handle multi-column layouts, equations, figures, and references from research papers and manuals.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Why Parse\r\n[Section titled \u201cWhy Parse\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#why-parse)\r\nHigh-quality document parsing is one of the most overlooked\u2014yet crucial\u2014steps in the LLM stack. Models can only reason with the information you give them, and most real-world documents are hard to interpret out of the box: multi-column layouts, merged table cells, charts embedded as images, handwritten annotations, scanned pages at odd angles.\r\n**Most parsers are bounding-box detectors bolted onto an OCR engine.** Parse is different.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 2133, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "e3c5fb8d-9b46-41cf-88b0-376332b2d678", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8786047f-5de5-4f7b-939e-ba6d2ca082b6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9ba0fdb9d10277d36469bfa79eb552e210ee783c92f1fe048df7ae6f64697b92", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "b3b4873e-f172-4882-82f6-87ba04382940", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "e07c5de8cdd004fde8300411e5e3b1a5a569adeaee5f1f4cb4c88d406acc4c94", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "b69a4f17-68f1-45be-98d7-d43ee48470ed", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "0b8cc932b49e8feb54d7155f66625280d9e594c196dd3f7f752ba78a278e315a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "**Most parsers are bounding-box detectors bolted onto an OCR engine.** Parse is different. It uses generative models for end-to-end document understanding, so layout, structure, tables, charts, and text all come out of the same reasoning pass\u2014instead of getting stitched back together from dozens of fragile heuristics. That\u2019s why it handles complex real-world documents where traditional parsers break down.\r\n### Parse vs. feeding PDFs directly to an LLM\r\n[Section titled \u201cParse vs. feeding PDFs directly to an LLM\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#parse-vs-feeding-pdfs-directly-to-an-llm)\r\nFor a single short document, passing the raw PDF to a multimodal model often works fine. At scale it breaks down: tables lose structure, scanned pages produce noisy OCR, and token cost scales linearly with raw page content regardless of whether it carried useful signal. Parse does the structural work once, upstream, so downstream models only see clean, layout-aware input.\r\n## Your first parse in 5 lines\r\n[Section titled \u201cYour first parse in 5 lines\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#your-first-parse-in-5-lines)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom llama_cloud import LlamaCloud\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nclient = LlamaCloud()  # reads LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile= client.files.create(file=\"doc.pdf\", purpose=\"parse\")\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nresult = client.parsing.parse(file_id=file.id, tier=\"agentic\", version=\"latest\")\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(result.markdown.pages[0].markdown)\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nFull setup for Python, TypeScript, REST, and the Web UI \u2192 .\r\n## Core Features\r\n[Section titled \u201cCore Features\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#core-features)\r\n  * **Flexible tiers** \u2014 pick the right cost-to-accuracy tradeoff for every job:\r\n    * **Agentic Plus** \u2014 state-of-the-art models for maximum accuracy on the hardest documents.\r\n    * **Agentic** \u2014 advanced parsing agents for complex, visually rich files.\r\n    * **Cost Effective** \u2014 balanced performance and cost for everyday workloads.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 2043, "end_char_idx": 4036, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "b69a4f17-68f1-45be-98d7-d43ee48470ed", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8786047f-5de5-4f7b-939e-ba6d2ca082b6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9ba0fdb9d10277d36469bfa79eb552e210ee783c92f1fe048df7ae6f64697b92", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "e3c5fb8d-9b46-41cf-88b0-376332b2d678", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9f4eb39337c165673fb1288c84383d2aabbca49c77d68fe865b6ddef10f49539", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "14280244-ab10-418b-9eac-84d13cce8fc5", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "704aa4dc6bb814e9e739a029d739260f4257f9166f2fe07b492b0ca55b7647f7", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "* **Agentic** \u2014 advanced parsing agents for complex, visually rich files.\r\n    * **Cost Effective** \u2014 balanced performance and cost for everyday workloads.\r\n    * **Fast** \u2014 lowest-latency, lowest-cost tier for plain-text documents at high volume; returns text and spatial text only (no markdown).\r\nSee the full [tier comparison \u2192](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/)\r\n  * **Layout-aware table extraction** \u2014 accurately recover tables from PDFs, scans, and images with cell structure preserved, so downstream models and spreadsheets get the data right the first time.\r\n  * **Chart & diagram parsing** \u2014 extract charts, plots, and diagrams into structured data so LLMs can reason over the numbers, not just the pixels.\r\n  * **Custom prompts & output schemas** \u2014 steer the parser with natural-language instructions or structured output schemas to shape the result to your pipeline.\r\n  * **Cost Optimizer \u2014 pay premium prices only on the pages that need it.** Parse routes each page in your document to the right tier automatically: simple pages go to the cheaper `cost_effective` tier, complex pages (tables, charts, multi-column layouts, diagrams) stay on your premium tier, and both run in parallel so there\u2019s no latency penalty. [Learn more \u2192](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#cost-optimizer)\r\n  * **130+ file types** \u2014 PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, HTML, JPEG, PNG, XML, EPUB, and [many more \u2192](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/general/supported_document_types/).\r\n  * **Production-ready** \u2014 automatic caching, webhooks, page-level controls, and versioned tiers you can pin for reproducible output in production.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Workflow\r\n[Section titled \u201cWorkflow\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/#workflow)\r\n  1. **Connect your documents** Upload or stream documents via our API, SDKs, or Web UI\u2014with built-in connectors for enterprise data sources.\r\n  2.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 3881, "end_char_idx": 5827, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "14280244-ab10-418b-9eac-84d13cce8fc5", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8786047f-5de5-4f7b-939e-ba6d2ca082b6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9ba0fdb9d10277d36469bfa79eb552e210ee783c92f1fe048df7ae6f64697b92", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "b69a4f17-68f1-45be-98d7-d43ee48470ed", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6612, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "6ea0d8a9712287d009e03352d124a6f5010fb786c88f5c418bc3deadf544041b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "**Connect your documents** Upload or stream documents via our API, SDKs, or Web UI\u2014with built-in connectors for enterprise data sources.\r\n  2. **Configure your parsing** Pick a tier for a quick start, or define a custom configuration with specific models, output formats, and parsing instructions for your use case.\r\n  3. **Get clean, structured results** Receive parsed output your pipeline can consume directly\u2014see [Output Options](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#output-options) for the full list.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * [ LlamaParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/)\r\n  * [ LiteParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/liteparse/)\r\n  * [ LlamaAgents ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/llamaagents/)\r\n  * [ LlamaIndex Framework ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 5685, "end_char_idx": 6520, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "d0d75d09-5c74-4e7c-aa2a-1def8fd8cbea", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "9879d55d-7375-4fad-bdd0-eeb20f52af85", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "ba7f0cc0fce990dda7bab04acfe8d4a1cd5e743cd1ba5a23e995b50a75ea2775", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#_top)\r\nGuide\r\nParse\r\nCopy Markdown\r\nOpen in **Claude**\r\nOpen in **ChatGPT**\r\nOpen in **Cursor**\r\n**Copy Markdown**\r\n**View as Markdown**\r\n# Getting Started\r\nQuick start guide for Parse, covering API key generation and document parsing using Python, TypeScript, the REST API, or the Web UI.\r\nGet your first parse job running in under a minute\u2014whether you prefer Python, TypeScript, the REST API, or the Web UI.\r\n## Before you begin\r\n[Section titled \u201cBefore you begin\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#before-you-begin)\r\nYou\u2019ll need a LlamaCloud API key. [**Get your API key \u2192**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/general/api_key)\r\nSet it as an environment variable so the SDKs pick it up automatically:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nexport LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=\"llx-...\"\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Your first parse job in 60 seconds\r\n[Section titled \u201cYour first parse job in 60 seconds\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#your-first-parse-job-in-60-seconds)\r\n\r\n\r\nInstall the SDK:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\npipinstallllama-cloud=2.1\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nParse a document:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom llama_cloud import LlamaCloud\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nclient = LlamaCloud()  # reads LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY from the environment\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# Upload and parse a document\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile= client.files.create(file=\"./attention_is_all_you_need.pdf\", purpose=\"parse\")\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nresult = client.parsing.parse(\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile_id=file.id,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntier=\"agentic\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nversion=\"latest\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexpand=[\"markdown\"],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# Print the markdown for the first page\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(result.markdown.pages[0].markdown)\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s it. The SDK handles job polling for you\u2014`client.parsing.parse()` blocks until the job finishes and returns the full result.\r\nPrefer async?", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1872, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "9879d55d-7375-4fad-bdd0-eeb20f52af85", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "d0d75d09-5c74-4e7c-aa2a-1def8fd8cbea", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "e3af7e503158ccdf778f6ab4430c5d508dbe1950833d679f81d83db3b90d79b1", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "96d27cc8-7914-43ce-8b41-2231b9f1de58", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "5f98eae5118711d7d1dba197f7222d04d82cbcf53395ed8985271885399b6ad7", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The SDK handles job polling for you\u2014`client.parsing.parse()` blocks until the job finishes and returns the full result.\r\nPrefer async? Swap `LlamaCloud` for `AsyncLlamaCloud` and `await` the calls:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom llama_cloud import AsyncLlamaCloud\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nimport asyncio\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nasyncdefmain():\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nclient = AsyncLlamaCloud()\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile=await client.files.create(file=\"./attention_is_all_you_need.pdf\", purpose=\"parse\")\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nresult =await client.parsing.parse(file_id=file.id, tier=\"agentic\", version=\"latest\", expand=[\"markdown\"])\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(result.markdown.pages[0].markdown)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nasyncio.run(main())\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Configure your parse job\r\n[Section titled \u201cConfigure your parse job\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#configure-your-parse-job)\r\nThe snippet above uses defaults. When you\u2019re ready to tune the output, add `input_options`, `output_options`, or `processing_options`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nresult = client.parsing.parse(\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile_id=file.id,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntier=\"agentic\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nversion=\"latest\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\noutput_options={\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"markdown\": {\"tables\": {\"output_tables_as_markdown\": True}},\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"images_to_save\": [\"screenshot\"],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprocessing_options={\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"ocr_parameters\": {\"languages\": [\"en\"]},\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexpand=[\"text\", \"markdown\", \"items\", \"images_content_metadata\"],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nEach group has a dedicated reference page:\r\n  * [Input Options](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#input-options) \u2014 page ranges, crop boxes, file-type-specific controls, and cache behavior\r\n  * [Output Options](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#output-options) \u2014 markdown styling, spatial text, screenshots, tables-as-spreadsheet, and more\r\n  * [Processing Options](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#processing-options) \u2014 OCR languages, ignore rules, chart parsing,", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1738, "end_char_idx": 3702, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "96d27cc8-7914-43ce-8b41-2231b9f1de58", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "9879d55d-7375-4fad-bdd0-eeb20f52af85", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "la