ata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "markdown);\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nRun it:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nnpxtsxparse.ts\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe SDK handles job polling for you\u2014`client.parsing.parse()` awaits until the job finishes and returns the full result.\r\n### Configure your parse job\r\n[Section titled \u201cConfigure your parse job\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#configure-your-parse-job-1)\r\nPass `input_options`, `output_options`, or `processing_options` to tune the output:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nconstresult=await client.parsing.parse({\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile_id: file.id,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntier: 'agentic',\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nversion: 'latest',\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\noutput_options: {\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nmarkdown: { tables: { output_tables_as_markdown: true } },\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nimages_to_save: ['screenshot'],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprocessing_options: {\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nocr_parameters: { languages: ['en'] },\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexpand: ['text', 'markdown', 'items', 'images_content_metadata'],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee the dedicated reference pages for the full set of options:\r\n  * [Retrieving Results](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/retrieving-results/) \u2014 every `expand` value and how to control what comes back\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019d prefer to skip the SDKs, the REST API lets you parse from any environment. Unlike the SDKs, the raw API is asynchronous: you upload a file, kick off a parse job, then poll for the result.\r\n#### 1. Upload a file\r\n[Section titled \u201c1.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 4626, "end_char_idx": 5998, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "5b88f410-cae8-485a-8014-d11547f2d255", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "f7b5468c-a818-44b8-b6cb-1fce00dd6579", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "9320586fcab493b4187ac1b30e586492f7fd1cb20d051bfea896be08b08f8e1b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "847089fb-3ce7-4d6c-811c-5a5be5dd84d8", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f026692897f79fcdcfd48514e5d67e589ae283ec77faecad676e6c0499188721", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Unlike the SDKs, the raw API is asynchronous: you upload a file, kick off a parse job, then poll for the result.\r\n#### 1. Upload a file\r\n[Section titled \u201c1. Upload a file\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#1-upload-a-file)\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl-XPOST\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://api.cloud.llamaindex.ai/api/v1/files/\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H'Accept: application/json'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H'Content-Type: multipart/form-data'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H\"Authorization: Bearer $LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY\"\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-F'file=@/path/to/your/file.pdf;type=application/pdf'\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nGrab the `id` from the response:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"id\": \"cafe1337-e0dd-4762-b5f5-769fef112558\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 2. Start a parse job\r\n[Section titled \u201c2. Start a parse job\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#2-start-a-parse-job)\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl-XPOST\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'https://api.cloud.llamaindex.ai/api/v2/parse'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H'Accept: application/json'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H'Content-Type: application/json'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H\"Authorization: Bearer $LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY\"\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n--data'{\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"file_id\": \"<file_id>\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"tier\": \"agentic\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"version\": \"latest\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll get a `job_id` back:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"id\": \"c0defee1-76a0-42c3-bbed-094e4566b762\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"status\": \"PENDING\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 3. Poll for the result\r\n[Section titled \u201c3. Poll for the result\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#3-poll-for-the-result)\r\nCall the result endpoint with your `job_id`. The `job.status` field will be `PENDING`, `RUNNING`, `COMPLETED`, or `FAILED`.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 5842, "end_char_idx": 7449, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "847089fb-3ce7-4d6c-811c-5a5be5dd84d8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "5b88f410-cae8-485a-8014-d11547f2d255", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "f1442954de5ec81f86f2f55b36f0141780c7f5c7bcac7f5cd5f127002e2999fc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "ff6425cd-82e6-4e0f-9644-c13cfd895907", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "8357ec98e9f48539f9c08777fcb5038b96f8a1fe17ac3a54de244884ad5f450e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The `job.status` field will be `PENDING`, `RUNNING`, `COMPLETED`, or `FAILED`. Keep polling until you see `COMPLETED`, then use `expand` to request the fields you want:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl-XGET\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'https://api.cloud.llamaindex.ai/api/v2/parse/<job_id>?expand=markdown'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H'Accept: application/json'\\\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-H\"Authorization: Bearer $LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY\"\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee [Retrieving Results](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/retrieving-results/) for every available `expand` value.\r\nIf you\u2019re non-technical or just want to sandbox Parse before writing any code, the Web UI is the fastest path.\r\n  1. Go to [**cloud.llamaindex.ai/parse**](https://cloud.llamaindex.ai/parse)\r\n  2. Pick a **Tier** from **Recommended Settings** , or switch to **Advanced Settings** to customize\r\n  3. Upload your document (or pick one of the sample use cases to try Parse without uploading anything)\r\n  4. Click **Run Parse** and view the results directly in the browser\r\n\r\n\r\n### Choosing a tier\r\n[Section titled \u201cChoosing a tier\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#choosing-a-tier)\r\nParse offers four tiers:\r\n  * [**Agentic Plus**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/#agentic-plus) \u2014 state-of-the-art models for maximum accuracy on the hardest documents (complex tables, dense charts, multi-column layouts).\r\n  * [**Agentic**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/#agentic) \u2014 advanced parsing agents for visually rich documents; a strong default for most workloads.\r\n  * [**Cost Effective**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/#cost-effective) \u2014 balanced performance and cost for text-heavy documents with minimal visual structure.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 7371, "end_char_idx": 9151, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "ff6425cd-82e6-4e0f-9644-c13cfd895907", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "847089fb-3ce7-4d6c-811c-5a5be5dd84d8", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "2c5dd90789c32bd2d22e13b6d0f8706b0502016c23b82e04569c0c0d4a89cd72", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "216d1bad-ff17-4b21-8c27-da7c45de4239", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "b21086d87abb8fdc1968eac0c7d2c2e1bf7d9295abbe269d43cd1f7830c93da8", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "* [**Cost Effective**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/#cost-effective) \u2014 balanced performance and cost for text-heavy documents with minimal visual structure.\r\n  * [**Fast**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/#fast) \u2014 the lowest-latency, lowest-cost tier for plain-text documents at high volume. Returns text and spatial text only \u2014 does not support markdown output.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Alternative: use a coding agent\r\n[Section titled \u201cAlternative: use a coding agent\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#alternative-use-a-coding-agent)\r\nIf you\u2019re already using Claude Code, Cursor, or another coding agent, you can skip the SDK entirely. Install the Parse agent skill and your agent can parse documents on the fly:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nnpxskillsaddrun-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills--skillllamaparse\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen just ask your agent things like:\r\n  * _\u201cParse this PDF and extract the text as markdown.\u201d_\r\n  * _\u201cExtract every table from each invoice in`./invoices` and save them as CSVs.\u201d_\r\n  * _\u201cParse this financial report with cost optimizer enabled.\u201d_\r\n\r\n\r\nThe agent writes the SDK calls for you. It picks the right tier, configures options, and saves output \u2014 without you needing to remember API details.\r\n**Requirements:** Node 18+, `LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY` in the environment, and a coding agent that supports [Vercel-style skills](https://skills.sh).\r\nTwo skills are available:  \r\n| Skill  | What it does  |  \r\n| --- | --- |  \r\n| **`llamaparse`** |  Full parsing via the LlamaCloud API \u2014 charts, tables, images, complex layouts  |  \r\n| **`liteparse`** |  Local-first, no API key needed \u2014 best for plain text and simple layouts  |  \r\nInstall both with `npx skills add run-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills` (no `--skill` flag).", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 8961, "end_char_idx": 10779, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "216d1bad-ff17-4b21-8c27-da7c45de4239", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "961d9afb-35f1-45f2-b9d8-e2d856b5c54a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "ff6425cd-82e6-4e0f-9644-c13cfd895907", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_name": "python_cloud_llamaparse_getting_started.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 12458, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "714bc6a3854ecf54925b157c9aaa723d6bf33948c1a05860f7c0b5d945aeb4d9", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Source on GitHub \u2192](https://github.com/run-llama/llamaparse-agent-skills)\r\n## Next steps\r\n[Section titled \u201cNext steps\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#next-steps)\r\n  * **Choose the right tier** \u2192 [Tiers](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/tiers/) explains when to use Agentic Plus vs. Agentic vs. Cost Effective vs. Fast.\r\n  * **Learn to configure options** \u2192 [Configuring Parse](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/) covers every knob \u2014 input, output, and processing options.\r\n  * **Save money on long documents** \u2192 [Cost Optimizer](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/guides/configuring-parse/#cost-optimizer) routes each page to the right tier automatically.\r\n  * **See real examples** \u2192 [Parse Examples](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/examples/) \u2014 runnable tutorials for common use cases.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Resources\r\n[Section titled \u201cResources\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#resources)\r\n  * [Pricing & credits](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/general/pricing/)\r\n  * Need structured data instead of markdown? Check out [LlamaExtract](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/extract/).\r\n\r\n\r\n  * [ LlamaParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/)\r\n  * [ LiteParse ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/liteparse/)\r\n  * [ LlamaAgents ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/llamaagents/)\r\n  * [ LlamaIndex Framework ](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 10780, "end_char_idx": 12334, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "16269a81-9daa-4f6e-8f5f-1a171d751404", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples.md", "file_name": "python_examples.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6011, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5ed61b2b-0466-4754-afc4-91ad6af7aeb5", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples.md", "file_name": "python_examples.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6011, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "e11b6330b6aa21a66b5762a8803aaf8e401da3e32babb7c3a8e6b4907ac5af68", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "b3181004-de1a-453d-bd80-06a81e719f1a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "be21f163e21fade98fdce4d92141c88404a385cbce4186895872e70ae198ad73", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/#_top)\r\n# Examples \r\nLlamaIndex provides a rich collection of examples demonstrating diverse use cases, integrations, and features. This page highlights key examples to help you get started.\r\nIn the navigation to the left, you will also find many example notebooks, displaying the usage of various llama-index components and use-cases.\r\n## Agents\r\n[Section titled \u201cAgents\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/#agents)\r\nBuild powerful AI assistants with LlamaIndex\u2019s agent capabilities:\r\n  * [Function Calling Agent](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/agent/agent_workflow_basic) - Learn the basics of Function Calling Agents and `AgentWorkflow`\r\n  * [React Agent](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/agent/react_agent) - Use the ReAct (Reasoning and Acting) pattern with agents\r\n  * [Code Act Agent](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/agent/code_act_agent) - Agents that can write and execute code\r\n  * [Multi-Agent Workflow](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/examples/agent/agent_workflow_multi) - Build a multi-agent workflow with `AgentWorkflow`\r\n\r\n\r\nYou might also be interested in the [general introduction to agents](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/understanding/agent).", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1322, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "b3181004-de1a-453d-bd80-06a81e719f1a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples.md", "file_name": "python_examples.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6011, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5ed61b2b-0466-4754-afc4-91ad6af7aeb5", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples.md", "file_name": "python_examples.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6011, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "e11b6330b6aa21a66b5762a8803aaf8e401da3e32babb7c3a8e6b4907ac5af68", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "16269a81-9daa-4f6e-8f5f-1a171d751404", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples.md", "file_name": "python_examples.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 6011, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "0f5a4a2b92ad3c3badf82ee97379f1778211a8de0a2c0e052451f74bdb034695", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "2336144b-da56-4586-aa33-c776129c2063", "node_type"