 slowly than the IAS-type machines, but were designed for fast input and output.) The first few sales were to government agencies, the A.C. Nielsen Company, and the Prudential Insurance Company.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 9552, "end_char_idx": 11648, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "187086d5-5310-41a2-b52f-9c3ace2bfe82", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_name": "python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 26616, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2232fc98-c257-4115-9298-c15e12ff7a94", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_name": "python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 26616, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "c766f7906dcbfd8468651f69aca14c57f4b39491d4348b003cb61ac9dd29f5ba", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "29466c97-636a-4cae-b35e-65791c2dfb56", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Daniel\\Documents\\llamaindex-course\\llamaindex-docs\\python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_name": "python_examples_agent_agent_workflow_multi.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 26616, "creation_date": "2026-04-23", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "ec9defdb8f6d951d6be2dbfe482edf9d9dc8f6746