te": "2026-04-23"}, "hash": "4512aeac69617e309b8aad2c279d1ad63e7f62209898e8bd223982a3171f9274", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "9879d55d-7375-4fad-bdd0-eeb20f52af85", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "ba7f0cc0fce990dda7bab04acfe8d4a1cd5e743cd1ba5a23e995b50a75ea2775", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "[Skip to content](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#_top)\r\nGuide\r\nParse\r\nCopy Markdown\r\nOpen in **Claude**\r\nOpen in **ChatGPT**\r\nOpen in **Cursor**\r\n**Copy Markdown**\r\n**View as Markdown**\r\n# Getting Started\r\nQuick start guide for Parse, covering API key generation and document parsing using Python, TypeScript, the REST API, or the Web UI.\r\nGet your first parse job running in under a minute\u2014whether you prefer Python, TypeScript, the REST API, or the Web UI.\r\n## Before you begin\r\n[Section titled \u201cBefore you begin\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#before-you-begin)\r\nYou\u2019ll need a LlamaCloud API key. [**Get your API key \u2192**](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/general/api_key)\r\nSet it as an environment variable so the SDKs pick it up automatically:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nexport LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=\"llx-...\"\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Your first parse job in 60 seconds\r\n[Section titled \u201cYour first parse job in 60 seconds\u201d](https://developers.llamaindex.ai/llamaparse/parse/getting_started/#your-first-parse-job-in-60-seconds)\r\n\r\n\r\nInstall the SDK:\r\nTerminal window\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\npipinstallllama-cloud=2.1\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nParse a document:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom llama_cloud import LlamaCloud\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nclient = LlamaCloud()  # reads LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY from the environment\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# Upload and parse a document\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile= client.files.create(file=\"./attention_is_all_you_need.pdf\", purpose=\"parse\")\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nresult = client.parsing.parse(\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfile_id=file.id,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ntier=\"agentic\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nversion=\"latest\",\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexpand=[\"markdown\"],\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# Print the markdown for the first page\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(result.markdown.pages[0].markdown)\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s it. The SDK handles job polling for you\u2014`client.parsing.parse()` blocks until the job finishes and returns the full result.\r\nPrefer async?", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1872, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "9879d55d-7375-4fad-bdd0-eeb20f52af85", "embedding": [-0.08944904804229736, -0.032365839928388596, -0.025040941312909126, -0.04794203117489815, 0.0427434928715229, -0.025531228631734848, -0.01997736468911171, -0.04602672532200813, -0.004686465486884117, 0.04884523153305054, 0.045270513743162155, -0.003494028002023697, 0.07141507416963577, -0.01858581230044365, -0.01861625909805298, 0.0012369859032332897, 0.013064990751445293, -0.017368163913488388, -0.03929998353123665, -0.008759936317801476, 0.011109462939202785, 0.010062772780656815, 0.012473959475755692, -0.04227566346526146, -0.010246949270367622, 0.057477232068777084, -0.029715988785028458, -0.06206148490309715, -0.06961674988269806, -0.18312838673591614, 0.0555216521024704, -0.09534865617752075, -0.017509235069155693, 0.02008739300072193, 0.00943476427346468, 0.024076448753476143, 0.03127823397517204, -0.0021569980308413506, 0.00978590827435255, 0.02040918916463852, 0.02924620732665062, -0.017977744340896606, -0.10333719849586487, 0.022268380969762802, -0.03463272005319595, -0.07410707324743271, 0.010035798884928226, 0.002486272482201457, 0.007483435794711113, 0.01182930450886488, -0.0944715142250061, -0.02441081963479519, -0.02068479172885418, -0.03658004477620125, 0.010631138458848, -0.0464915335178